      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T21:48:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point, thanks for catching. SDKs in the RT don\u0027t get runtime permissions so they should not be requesting or changing this permission. I\u0027m confirming with permission team on this, but I think we can omit sandbox UIDs for this change given:\n1. sandbox UIDs would never have this permission, and\n2. It might be overengineering to add more sandbox cases on top of the SDK RT and existing checks\n\nRemoved the sandbox uid logic, LMK what you think.",
