      "message": "Question : is this actually necessary ? Or more to the point : is this actually called every time checkPermissionForDataDelivery can change ? I haven\u0027t tested, but ISTM that the result of checkPermissionForDataDelivery can change very often (every time the app goes to the foreground/background or so) and onPermissionsChanged offering only a UID only gives you a pretty heavy way to check. What that seems to imply is that it would not be called every time.\n\nCan you please check ? Either test it directly or point to comments making it explicit.",
